ker\",\"welcome.v2.agents.ai.photo.editor.chat.greeting\":\"Hi, I’m AI Photo Editor. I can retouch a portrait, try a new look, swap the background, or reimagine your photo in a whole new style. Send me a photo and tell me what you’re imagining—I’ll help you bring it to life.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.ai.photo.editor.chat.input.image.alt\":\"Portrait photo provided for editing\",\"welcome.v2.agents.ai.photo.editor.chat.prompt\":\"Turn this photo into a realistic American high school yearbook portrait.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.ai.photo.editor.chat.response\":\"I created three American high school yearbook portraits. Choose your favorite, or ask me to adjust the outfit, backdrop, or pose.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.ai.photo.editor.chat.result.image.alt\":\"AI-generated American high school yearbook portrait\",\"welcome.v2.agents.ai.photo.editor.description\":\"Retouch, transform, and reimagine photos in any style.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.ai.photo.editor.name\":\"AI Photo Editor\",\"welcome.v2.agents.brochure.creator.chat.artifact.meta\":\"PDF · 2.6MB · 6 pages\",\"welcome.v2.agents.brochure.creator.chat.artifact.title\":\"SORA NUSA ECO RETREAT\",\"welcome.v2.agents.brochure.creator.chat.greeting\":\"Hi! I'm Brochure Creator. Share your brand, product, service, event, or portfolio materials, and I'll turn them into a professional brochure with a well-structured layout, persuasive copy, and polished visual design.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.brochure.creator.chat.input.image.alt\":\"Sora Nusa Eco Retreat photos and brand notes\",\"welcome.v2.agents.brochure.creator.chat.prompt\":\"Create a polished six-page digital brochure for Sora Nusa Eco Retreat using the attached photos and brand notes.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.brochure.creator.chat.response\":\"Your six-page Sora Nusa Eco Retreat brochure is ready. It uses all five supplied photos to present the retreat story, villas, dining, local experiences, and opening offer in a natural cream, deep-green, and terracotta design.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.brochure.creator.chat.result.image.alt\":\"Sora Nusa Eco Retreat brochure preview\",\"welcome.v2.agents.brochure.creator.description\":\"Turn your content into designed brochures.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.brochure.creator.name\":\"Brochure Creator\",\"welcome.v2.agents.creative.designer.chat.greeting\":\"Hi, I’m Creative Designer. I can turn a rough idea into a polished logo, ad, social post, product visual, or illustration. Tell me what you’d like to make—and if you have any copy, images, or references, just drop them in.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.creative.designer.chat.prompt\":\"Create a logo and Instagram posters for EVERA, a refillable body-wash brand.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.creative.designer.chat.result.image.alt\":\"EVERA logo and Instagram poster designs\",\"welcome.v2.agents.creative.designer.description\":\"Turn rough ideas into polished visual designs.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.creative.designer.name\":\"Creative Designer\",\"welcome.v2.agents.data.analysis.chat.greeting\":\"Hi! I'm Data Analysis Assistant. Share a Google Sheet, upload a spreadsheet or CSV, or just paste a table — then tell me what you want to understand. I'll check the numbers, look for trends and anomalies, and turn what I find into a clear answer or a report you can act on. I can also set it to run on a schedule.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.data.analysis.chat.prompt\":\"Analyze my TikTok and Instagram data. What should I create next?\",\"welcome.v2.agents.data.analysis.chat.response\":\"Your creator analytics report is ready. Discover your top audience, best content, revenue drivers, next steps, three content pillars, and a 30-day plan.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.data.analysis.chat.result.image.alt\":\"Creator analytics report preview\",\"welcome.v2.agents.data.analysis.description\":\"Analyze data to uncover trends and actionable insights.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.data.analysis.name\":\"Data Analysis\",\"welcome.v2.agents.description\":\"Each AI agent comes with expert knowledge and professional workflows built in, giving you a highly capable team for different kinds of work—without the setup.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.h5.panel.alt\":\"Migoo AI agent list and Video Ad Producer conversation\",\"welcome.v2.agents.job.apply.chat.greeting\":\"Hi! I'm Job Apply. Tell me where you're headed — a new job, a switch, a career change — and I'll find roles that fit, sharpen your resume and interviews, and help you apply. Give me a direction or a resume to start, or just tell me what you're looking for.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.job.apply.chat.prompt\":\"I’m a content marketing specialist with 3 years of experience, and I want to move into an AI Content Strategist or AI Marketing Operations role in Singapore. Review my resume and recommend roles that fit.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.job.apply.description\":\"Find matching roles and strengthen your applications.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.job.apply.name\":\"Job Apply\",\"welcome.v2.agents.list.label\":\"Agent\",\"welcome.v2.agents.research.assistant.chat.artifact.meta\":\"PDF · 6.9MB · 26 pages\",\"welcome.v2.agents.research.assistant.chat.artifact.title\":\"Research of Gen Z\",\"welcome.v2.agents.research.assistant.chat.greeting\":\"Hi! I'm Research Assistant. What are we digging into? Give me a question, a market, a technology, or any topic — I can research it from multiple angles and deliver a structured report you can act on.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.research.assistant.chat.prompt\":\"Research how Gen Z consumers in Indonesia, Thailand, and Vietnam discover and buy beauty products.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.research.assistant.chat.response\":\"Your Gen Z Beauty & Personal-Care market brief is ready, with consumer insights and country-level recommendations.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.research.assistant.chat.result.image.alt\":\"Gen Z beauty market research report preview\",\"welcome.v2.agents.research.assistant.description\":\"Research any topic and deliver structured reports.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.research.assistant.name\":\"Research Assistant\",\"welcome.v2.agents.slide.assistant.chat.greeting\":\"Hi! I'm Slide Assistant. Got a topic, some notes, or raw data? Drop it here and I'll build you a clean deck — we'll nail down the outline first, then design every slide.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.slide.assistant.chat.prompt\":\"Turn these notes and sales data into a strategic growth plan for EVERA, focused on market expansion.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.slide.assistant.chat.response\":\"Your Strategic Growth Plan is ready, with clear priorities and an actionable expansion roadmap.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.slide.assistant.chat.result.image.alt\":\"EVERA strategic growth plan slide deck\",\"welcome.v2.agents.slide.assistant.description\":\"Build polished slide decks from notes, files, and data.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.slide.assistant.name\":\"Slide Assistant\",\"welcome.v2.agents.video.ad.producer.chat.greeting\":\"Hi, I’m Video Ad Producer. Send me a product image, brand assets, product link, or a simple brief, then tell me the publishing or ad channel and your goal. I’ll turn it into a conversion-focused video ad up to 15 seconds long.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.video.ad.producer.chat.prompt\":\"Using this store photo and my shop link, create a 15-second promotional video for my crystal shop.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.video.ad.producer.chat.prompt.image.alt\":\"Crystal products displayed in a shop\",\"welcome.v2.agents.video.ad.producer.chat.response\":\"I reviewed the 30 products in your store and selected the strongest visuals to feature. Here’s a warm, calming promotional video built around “Find Your Inner Light”.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.video.ad.producer.chat.response.video.alt\":\"Promotional video preview for a crystal shop\",\"welcome.v2.agents.video.ad.producer.description\":\"Turn product assets into conversion-focused video ads.\",\"welcome.v2.agents.video.ad.producer.name\":\"Video Ad Producer\",\"welcome.v2.agents.website.builder.chat.greeting\":\"Hi! I'm Website Builder. Share your content — a doc, some data, or even rough notes — and I'