e digest of the five most important recent AI developments for my industry, role, and priorities, using credible sources. For each, explain in one sentence why it matters to me and include the source link and date. Separate confirmed news from analysis or speculation.\",\"skills\":[{\"registry_id\":\"24\",\"skill_type\":2,\"skill_name\":\"get-news\"}]},{\"id\":\"healthy_eating_plan\",\"title\":\"Healthy Eating Plan\",\"query\":\"Research practical, balanced, and sustainable healthy eating habits for modern lifestyles using the latest research reports and scientific evidence.\"}]},{\"id\":\"job_search\",\"title\":\"Job Search\",\"icon_url\":\"https://cache-media-sg.migoo.ai/api/v4/50095895/beeai-budee-live-sg/new-task/20260730/job_search.png\",\"suggestions\":[{\"id\":\"linkedin_profile_improvement\",\"title\":\"LinkedIn Profile Improvement\",\"query\":\"Review my LinkedIn profile and propose specific edits to the Headline, About, Experience, and Skills sections to improve positioning and search visibility, with brief rationales. Do not make changes without my approval.\",\"skills\":[{\"registry_id\":\"38\",\"skill_type\":2,\"skill_name\":\"profile-optimizer\"}]},{\"id\":\"tailored_cv\",\"title\":\"Tailored CV\",\"query\":\"Tailor my resume to the provided job description. Prioritize relevant experience, achievements, and keywords; quantify impact only when supported; and improve clarity without inventing facts. Deliver a polished PDF resume plus an ATS-friendly plain-text version.\",\"skills\":[{\"registry_id\":\"39\",\"skill_type\":2,\"skill_name\":\"resume\"}]},{\"id\":\"write_a_cover_letter\",\"title\":\"Write a Cover Letter\",\"query\":\"Write a cover letter for the provided job I want to apply for. Keep it to one page and write it in a natural voice, avoiding stock openings such as \\\"I am writing to express my strong interest.\\\" Every claim must be supported by something on my resume. Then draft a short LinkedIn message for the recruiter, and a separate one