logo directions using any brand context I have shared. If none is available, create a personal brand from my name, initials, and what you know about my style. Include a primary mark, simple icon, and monochrome version for each, then ask which direction I want to refine.\"},{\"id\":\"product_images\",\"title\":\"Product Images\",\"query\":\"Create three e-commerce product images. If I have shared a product photo, use its main product; otherwise use a teacup. Include a clean main image, a lifestyle image, and a feature image based only on visible or verified selling points. Format them for major marketplaces, keep the product consistent, then ask which image I want to refine.\"},{\"id\":\"product_ad_video\",\"title\":\"Product Ad Video\",\"query\":\"Create a 15-second vertical ad for the product in my photo; if none is available, use a teacup. Use three shots: the user’s need, the product in action, and the outcome with a concise CTA. Give each shot one focal point and one camera movement, keep the product consistent, and add natural voiceover. After generating, ask whether I want a different opening hook.\"},{\"id\":\"brochure\",\"title\":\"Brochure\",\"query\":\"Design a polished tri-fold brochure using any brand context I have shared; otherwise create a sample for a modern creative studio. Include a cover, value proposition, three offerings, proof points, CTA, and an editable contact area. Keep it concise, then ask what I want to refine.\"},{\"id\":\"menu\",\"title\":\"Menu\",\"query\":\"Design a polished one-page menu using any restaurant details I have shared; otherwise create a sample for a modern neighborhood café. Use clear categories, highlight three signature items, and keep names, descriptions, and prices editable. Make it suitable for print and mobile, then ask whether I want another visual direction.\"},{\"id\":\"invitation_card\",\"title\":\"Invitation Card\",\"query\":\"Design a polished invitation using any event details I have shared; otherwise create a sample for a summer rooftop dinner. Show the event name, date, time, location, host, dress code, and RSVP area with clear hierarchy. Make it suitable for digital and print, then ask whether I want another color direction.\"}]},{\"id\":\"video\",\"title\":\"Video\",\"icon_url\":\"https://cache-media-sg.migoo.ai/api/v4/50095895/beeai-budee-live-sg/new-task/20260730/video.png\",\"suggestions\":[{\"id\":\"my_photo_vlog\",\"title\":\"My Photo Vlog\",\"query\":\"Create a 15-second vertical photo vlog using no more than nine of my recent life photos. Preserve the original people and events rather than inventing new ones. After generating, ask whether I want a calmer or more energetic edit.\",\"skills\":[{\"registry_id\":\"53\",\"skill_type\":2,\"skill_name\":\"video-gen\"}]},{\"id\":\"my_short_drama\",\"title\":\"My Short Drama\",\"query\":\"Create a 60-second vertical short drama starring me, using my photos and what you know about me. Build one relatable everyday conflict and structure it in five connected beats: setup, trigger, escalation, turning point, and a satisfying or surprising ending. Keep my appearance recognizable, use natural acting, concise dialogue, clear sound, and coherent pacing. After generating, ask whether I want to change the conflict, tone, or ending.\",\"skills\":[{\"registry_id\":\"53\",\"skill_type\":2,\"skill_name\":\"video-gen\"}]},{\"id\":\"funny_pet_story\",\"title\":\"Funny Pet Story\",\"query\":\"A 15-second surreal and humorous pet short film: a chubby orange tabby wearing a white baseball cap walks and sits upright like a human, experiencing a photorealistic yet absurd slice of campus life inside a crowded, brightly lit university cafeteria.\\nIn the first half, the cat carries an orange tray filled with braised pork, green vegetables, and rice in both paws. It urgently searches for an empty seat while weaving through the crowd, followed by several other cats also carrying trays. Stainless-steel tables and chairs fill the background, with the student crowd softly blurred. Use an eye-level medium shot that tracks backward with the cat, incorporating a slightly low angle to strengthen its presence. Use a medium telephoto lens and shallow depth of field to compress the space while maintaining a busy, focused, and subtly comedic rhythm.\\nThe camera then naturally pushes in to a close shot and close-up at the table. After sitting down, the orange tabby uses chopsticks in its right paw to pick up a piece of braised pork and place it in its mouth, followed by realistic chewing and swallowing. Its expression gradually changes from tense to satisfied and delighted. Show no text, subtitles, speaker icons, logos, or watermarks. Convey the self-comforting thought “Let’s eat first” entirely through the performance.\\nEnd on a close-up after the meal. The plate is empty, and the cat puts down its chopsticks, tilts its head back, closes its eyes, and opens its mouth, appearing completely full, relieved, and lazily content. Keep the background softly blurred. Maintain an AI-generated photorealistic style, a charming pet-story atmosphere, and natural anthropomorphic humor throughout. Do not show the cat walking on all fours, distorted gripping, graphic or frightening imagery, sharply focused background people competing for attention, or chaotic food splashes.\",\"skills\":[{\"registry_id\":\"53\",\"skill_type\":2,\"skill_name\":\"video-gen\"}]}]},{\"id\":\"image\",\"title\":\"Image\",\"icon_url\":\"https://cache-media-sg.migoo.ai/api/v4/50095895/beeai-budee-live-sg/new-task/20260730/image.png\",\"suggestions\":[{\"id\":\"linkedin_photo\",\"title\":\"LinkedIn Photo\",\"query\":\"Create a professional square LinkedIn photo using my photos as identity references. Use a head-and-shoulders composition, direct gaze, a natural confident expression, professional attire, a neutral background, balanced studio lighting, and realistic 2K photography. Preserve my identity and skin texture, add no text or watermark, then ask