story\",\"title\":\"Personal Story\",\"query\":\"Write an authentic Instagram caption about completing a first solo sunrise hike. Use a warm first-person voice, reflect on overcoming hesitation, and finish with a natural question, light emojis, and three hashtags.\"},{\"id\":\"event_highlights\",\"title\":\"Event Highlights\",\"query\":\"Create an Instagram highlight for a neighborhood sustainability workshop. Emphasize practical learning and community connections, thank the participants and organizers, and finish with an engagement question and five hashtags.\"}]},{\"id\":\"linkedin_post\",\"title\":\"LinkedIn Post\",\"icon_url\":\"https://cache-media-sg.migoo.ai/api/v4/50095895/beeai-budee-live-sg/new-task/20260806-task-chips-png-v1/linkedin.png\",\"suggestions\":[{\"id\":\"hiring_post\",\"title\":\"Hiring Post\",\"query\":\"Create a storytelling-style LinkedIn hiring post for a Business Development Specialist at a fictional clean-mobility startup. Explain the mission, ideal candidate, and potential impact, then close with a clear invitation to apply.\"},{\"id\":\"industry_insights\",\"title\":\"Industry Insights\",\"query\":\"Create a LinkedIn post about how AI is changing marketing teams. Open with a strong observation, explain why human judgment still matters, share three practical takeaways, and finish with a discussion question.\"},{\"id\":\"career_milestone\",\"title\":\"Career Milestone\",\"query\":\"Write a LinkedIn post about leading a first cross-functional product launch. Use a humble but confident tone, share lessons about alignment, communication, and adaptability, thank the team, and finish with a question.\"}]},{\"id\":\"marketing_website\",\"title\":\"Marketing Website\",\"icon_url\":\"https://cache-media-sg.migoo.ai/api/v4/50095895/beeai-budee-live-sg/new-task/20260730/website.png\",\"suggestions\":[{\"id\":\"landing_page\",\"title\":\"Landing Page\",\"query\":\"Build a mobile-first landing page for a fictional four-week seller growth campaign ins